This product bundles a vendored copy of ICU (International Components for
Unicode) in the icu4c/ directory:

  - the ICU "common" and "i18n" C/C++ sources, compiled directly by the cgo
    binding; and
  - a trimmed, collation-only build of the ICU data (icu4c/icudt78l.dat).

